rescription.","example_zh":"藥師仔細核對處方上的劑量。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/dosage-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-downturn-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"downturn","sort_order":1,"sense":"衰退","alt_zh":"城鎮商店街有幾家關閉的空店面，居民緩緩走過。","example":"The economic downturn left several shops on the street empty.","example_zh":"經濟衰退讓街上好幾間店面空置。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/downturn-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-draftsman-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"draftsman","sort_order":1,"sense":"製圖員","alt_zh":"成年製圖員在大型工作桌用直尺與繪圖工具完成無字圖書館藍圖。","example":"The draftsman prepared precise plans for the new library.","example_zh":"製圖員為新圖書館繪製精確設計圖。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/draftsman-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-drainage-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"drainage","sort_order":1,"sense":"排水","alt_zh":"雨後校園步道乾淨暢通，清水沿兩側排水溝流走。","example":"The new drainage channels kept rainwater off the school path.","example_zh":"新的排水溝讓雨水不再積在校園步道上。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/drainage-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-drastic-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"drastic","sort_order":1,"sense":"激烈的","alt_zh":"社區居民把大型灑水設備停用，改用少量回收雨水精準澆灌。","example":"The drought forced a drastic reduction in water use.","example_zh":"乾旱迫使人們大幅減少用水。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/drastic-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-dubious-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"dubious","sort_order":1,"sense":"可疑的","alt_zh":"成年鑑定員皺眉用放大鏡查看外觀過於嶄新的古錢幣。","example":"The expert looked dubious when shown the unusually shiny old coin.","example_zh":"看到異常閃亮的古幣時，專家露出懷疑神情。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/dubious-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-dysfunction-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"dysfunction","sort_order":1,"sense":"功能障礙","alt_zh":"高中生檢查轉向異常的機器人，老師指出鬆動感測器。","example":"A loose sensor caused dysfunction in the model robot's steering system.","example_zh":"鬆動的感測器使模型機器人的轉向系統失常。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/dysfunction-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-eagerness-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"eagerness","sort_order":1,"sense":"渴望","alt_zh":"高中生在科學課專注看老師示範，紛紛興奮舉手發問。","example":"The students' eagerness to learn was clear from their many questions.","example_zh":"學生踴躍提問，充分展現求知的渴望。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/eagerness-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-edict-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"edict","sort_order":1,"sense":"法令","alt_zh":"虛構歷史故事中，成年使者展開帶封印的無字法令，伐木者收起工具保留森林。","example":"The royal edict required the ancient woodland to be protected.","example_zh":"王室法令要求保護古老林地。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/edict-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-efficacy-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"efficacy","sort_order":1,"sense":"功效","alt_zh":"科學教室裡，高中生比較兩個透明濾水模型處理混濁水的表現，無飲用行為。","example":"The students tested the efficacy of two water filters.","example_zh":"學生測試兩種濾水器的功效。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/efficacy-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","s