t's eligibility for the science competition.","example_zh":"老師確認每位學生是否符合科學競賽資格。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/eligibility-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-elite-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"elite","sort_order":1,"sense":"精英","alt_zh":"才華出眾的成年青年音樂家在正式音樂廳專注演奏。","example":"The festival invited an elite of talented young musicians to perform.","example_zh":"音樂節邀請一群出色的年輕音樂家演出。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/elite-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-eloquence-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"eloquence","sort_order":1,"sense":"口才","alt_zh":"高中女生向同學生動講述歷史故事，大家專注理解並微笑。","example":"Her eloquence made the complex story easy to follow.","example_zh":"她流暢的口才讓複雜故事變得容易理解。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/eloquence-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-emancipation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"emancipation","sort_order":1,"sense":"解放","alt_zh":"博物館展示打開的舊枷鎖與走向自由的歷史畫作，觀眾肅穆，無人受束縛。","example":"The exhibit explored the struggle for emancipation from slavery.","example_zh":"展覽探討擺脫奴隸制度、爭取解放的歷程。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/emancipation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-embargo-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"embargo","sort_order":1,"sense":"禁運","alt_zh":"成年海關人員在港口把指定貨箱留在封鎖倉區，遠處船隻停靠，無文字。","example":"The embargo stopped certain goods from leaving the harbor.","example_zh":"禁運令阻止某些貨物離開港口。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/embargo-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-embodiment-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"embodiment","sort_order":1,"sense":"體現","alt_zh":"居民與高中志工一起欣賞修復後花木茂盛的社區花園。","example":"The carefully restored garden was an embodiment of the community's care.","example_zh":"細心修復的花園，體現社區居民的關懷。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/embodiment-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-emigrant-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"emigrant","sort_order":1,"sense":"移民","alt_zh":"成年旅人在家中把家人合照放入行李，準備告別親友出國。","example":"The emigrant packed family photographs before leaving for a new country.","example_zh":"那位移出國門的人在前往新國家前，打包家人照片。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/emigrant-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-eminent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"eminent","sort_order":1,"sense":"傑出的","alt_zh":"受敬重的成年天文學家在教室向高中生展示星球模型與望遠鏡。","example":"An eminent astronomer visited our school to discuss the stars.","example_zh":"一位傑出的天文學家來校談論星空。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/eminent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-empower-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"empower","sort_order":1,"sense":"賦權","alt_zh":"高中生在老師支持下自信完成腳踏車簡單維修，朋友讚賞。","example":"Learning to repair bicycles can empower students to solve practical problems.","example_zh":"學會修理腳踏車，能讓學生更有能力解決實際問題。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/empower-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-enclave-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"enclave","sort_order":1,"sense":"飛地","alt_zh":"高中地理課桌上立體地圖，一小塊綠色領土完全被大片米色陸地包圍，無文字。","example":"The map showed an enclave surrounded by another country's territory.","example_zh":"地圖顯示一塊被另一國領土包圍的飛地。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/enclave-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-encryption-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"encryption","sort_order":1,"sense":"加密","alt_zh":"老師向高中生展示簡單鎖住信件的實體模型，旁邊電腦顯示無字鎖頭圖示。","example":"The lesson showed how encryption helps protect a message from unwanted readers.","example_zh":"課程展示加密如何保護訊息，避免被未授權的人讀取。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/encryption-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-endorsement-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"endorsement","sort_order":1,"sense":"背書；支持推薦","alt_zh":"教練微笑支持安全帽教學活動，高中生踴躍加入，沒有品牌。","example":"The coach's endorsement encouraged more students to join the safety program.","example_zh":"教練的支持推薦，鼓勵更多學生參加安全課程。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/endorsement-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-endowment-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"endowment","sort_order":1,"sense":"捐贈基金","alt_zh":"成年校友與圖書館員正式交付捐贈基金文件，後方學生使用新書。","example":"The alumnus created an endowment to support the library for many years.","example_zh":"校友設立捐贈基金，長期支持圖書館。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/endowment-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-enigmatic-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"enigmatic","sort_order":1,"sense":"神秘的","alt_zh":"高中生在歷史社團桌上，用放大鏡觀察舊鑰匙上不屬文字的奇特幾何記號。","example":"The old key had an enigmatic symbol that no one could explain.","example_zh":"那把舊鑰匙上有個沒人能解釋的神祕符號。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/enigmatic-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-enlightenment-01-v1","level":"senio